    <string name="boot_permissions_note_title">Permissions</string>
    <string name="boot_permissions_note_body">Boot access does not use a separate permission popup. Android grants it when GhostLock is installed. Only notifications are asked so progress and results can appear on the lock screen. Enable \"Run before unlock\" for Direct Boot before your PIN. Open GhostLock once after install so CPU settings are saved. On some devices, also allow autostart or disable battery restrictions for GhostLock in system settings.</string>
